Title: "Variadic Is"
Id: "55c65838-cc6e-45c8-80a0-52b1b8d8e41f"

Text: "A single `is` statement can apply to multiple subjects.

```mlg-fragment
A, B is \set
x1, x2 \"in\" A
```

The statement is treated as one fact for each subject. For example, `A, B is \set` establishes both `A is \set` and `B is \set`."
Id: "fbf6c057-68fb-438c-8ee9-f6401f4352f8"
